Declare:

logic [1:0][3:0][7:0] mem;

Write a program to:

Assign values to all elements.
Display mem[0][0].
Display mem[0][1].
Display mem[1][2].
Display one bit such as mem[1][2][7].
------------------------------------------
// Code your testbench here
